WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.021
You promote your webinar.

00:02.092 --> 00:03.763
Hundreds of people sign up.

00:03.834 --> 00:04.839
Then the day comes,

00:04.839 --> 00:06.629
and most of them never show up.

00:07.679 --> 00:09.008
Meet ShowUp AI.

00:09.077 --> 00:11.865
It gets the people who register to actually attend.

00:11.936 --> 00:13.823
And it works with the webinar tool

00:13.823 --> 00:14.861
you already use.

00:15.910 --> 00:17.117
Here's how it works.

00:17.187 --> 00:18.484
Four simple steps.

00:19.335 --> 00:19.925
One.

00:19.996 --> 00:21.245
Paste your event link.

00:21.315 --> 00:22.956
Zoom, Teams, Google Meet,

00:22.956 --> 00:24.288
or any event page.

00:25.138 --> 00:25.767
Two.

00:25.838 --> 00:28.238
ShowUp AI plans eleven touches for you,

00:28.238 --> 00:30.515
from three weeks before your event to

00:30.515 --> 00:31.588
two days after.

00:32.539 --> 00:33.204
Three.

00:33.274 --> 00:35.618
It writes every message in your brand's voice.

00:35.689 --> 00:38.082
Email, WhatsApp, LinkedIn, Facebook,

00:38.082 --> 00:40.692
Instagram, SMS, and calendar invites.

00:41.642 --> 00:42.292
Four.

00:42.362 --> 00:43.697
You review and approve.

00:43.767 --> 00:45.713
Nothing goes out without your yes.

00:45.784 --> 00:47.805
Then everything sends on schedule,

00:47.805 --> 00:49.708
and the join link lands one hour

00:49.708 --> 00:50.988
before you go live.

00:52.037 --> 00:54.234
After the event, see exactly who showed

00:54.234 --> 00:55.229
up, by channel.

00:55.299 --> 00:56.789
Attendees get a thank you.

00:56.860 --> 00:58.596
No-shows get their own follow-up.

00:59.546 --> 01:00.576
Fuller rooms.

01:00.646 --> 01:01.760
Fewer no-shows.

01:01.830 --> 01:03.284
Zero extra hours.

01:04.534 --> 01:05.902
Keep your webinar tool.

01:05.972 --> 01:07.381
Fix your show-up rate.

01:07.451 --> 01:11.605
Try ShowUp AI free for fourteen days, at showupai.live.
